1
00:00:12,199 --> 00:00:18,800
I drop the coat, the crimson falls,

2
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:25,339
My mother’s ghost wrapped round my skin.

3
00:00:25,559 --> 00:00:32,320
We step beneath the gilded halls,

4
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:39,719
Where fear ends and our lives begin.

5
00:00:40,109 --> 00:00:46,539
Crystal light and mirrors high,

6
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:53,219
Golden wood beneath our feet!

7
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:59,170
Look at me and do not lie,

8
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:09,650
Where the dream and terror meet!

9
00:01:12,379 --> 00:01:18,849
A sea of amber, chandeliers,

10
00:01:19,069 --> 00:01:25,299
The room is frozen in a trance.

11
00:01:25,519 --> 00:01:32,219
Behind us lie the frozen years,

12
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:39,450
Tonight is more than just a dance.

13
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:46,519
Take my hand and break the chain,

14
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:53,319
Show me what a king can dare!

15
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:59,159
Claim my fire through the pain,

16
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:10,039
In the silence of the glare!

17
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:18,860
You walk ahead, your shoulders tight,

18
00:02:19,090 --> 00:02:25,509
Still hiding in your quiet shell.

19
00:02:25,699 --> 00:02:32,099
Step out with me into the light,

20
00:02:32,229 --> 00:02:38,750
Or leave me in this golden hell.

21
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:46,639
Crimson gown on polished floor,

22
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:53,360
Now or never, make your stand!

23
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:59,189
Love me or unlock the door,

24
00:02:59,310 --> 00:03:13,409
Place your kingdom in my hand!